tps://static-v2.boisedev.com/assets/3cffa70b-bd30-43bc-8a9e-62008bbc7dff.png","line":88,"embedded":true},{"title":"Red Ridge Village","target":"https://dfdevelopmentllc.com/communities/red-ridge-village/","line":92},{"title":"A traffic study","target":"https://www.co.valley.id.us/media/Departments/PlanningZoning/PUD%2026-001%20Red%20Ridge%20Village%20Application/Appendix%20J%20Traffic%20Impact%20Study.pdf","line":94},{"title":"St. Luke's Health Plan - 2026 2:1","target":"https://static-v2.boisedev.com/assets/3cffa70b-bd30-43bc-8a9e-62008bbc7dff.png","line":98,"embedded":true}],"metadata":{"title":"Valley P&Z: Lake Cascade water quality ‘hinge pin’ for Red Ridge Village proposal","source":"https://valleylookout.com/2026/05/22/valley-pz-lake-cascade-water-quality-hinge-pin-for-red-ridge-village-proposal/?utm_source=newsletters.idahocapitalsun.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=isp-transports-more-immigrants-to-ice-record-visitation-at-minidoka-column-rebuilding-civics-participation&_bhlid=f2edb4ac7b488b58fe0c4fbd24a91cec588981f4","author":["[[Drew Dodson - Valley Lookout Editor]]"],"published":"2026-05-22","created":"2026-07-08","description":"The environmental risk posed to Lake Cascade could be a deciding factor on a plan to build what local officials have described as a “new city” near McCall.  On Thursday, the Valley County Planning and Zoning Commission met with representatives from regulatory agencies and DF Development to discuss the company’s plan for Red Ridge Village, […]"},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},